OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be rather cloudy but mostly dry
OL,7,Fwith only a chance of the odd shower.
OL,8,FThe night will be dry in the north
OL,9,Fwith some clear spells, cloudy in the
OL,10,Fsouth with just the odd spot of
OL,11,Fdrizzle.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FDry with some bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells at first, mainly over northern
OL,15,Fcounties, rather cloudy in the south.
OL,16,FStaying dry in the afternoon with
OL,17,Fvariable cloud and bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
