OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FShowery rain at times on Monday,
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy. Bright spells and
OL,8,Fscattered showers on Tuesday. Dry,
OL,9,Fbright start on Wednesday before rain
OL,10,Fspreads east in the afternoon and
OL,11,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
